      <name>Granny Smith Apples Purée BRIX 11</name>
      <category>Fruit</category>
      <info>Confidence: high
Granny Smith apple purée with BRIX 11 is typical of unsweetened apple purée. Carbohydrates are set to 11.5g/100g (BRIX ≈ total sugars + fiber + minor polysaccharides). Sugars breakdown based on typical apple composition: mostly fructose, then glucose and sucrose. Fiber, protein, fat, ash, and minerals estimated from USDA data for applesauce/purée. No added sugars, dairy, or cocoa.</info>
